Notes on provenance

Maru was created by Ian Piumarta at Viewpoints Research Institute as part of
the STEPS project. Individual source files may carry their own copyright
headers (for example gc.c, which carries Ian Piumarta's original 2008
MIT-style permission notice). Those headers remain in force for the files
they cover and are compatible with the terms above.

Dan Amelang's original MIT-LICENSE file (2010) was removed from this
repository in December 2012 when a new upstream snapshot of Maru was
imported. This file restores MIT licensing for the whole tree.

Third-party code vendored under tools/ retains its own license.
